  {
   "kind": "field_value",
   "field_name": "Primary Text",
   "text": "Momcozy® Official | Best Breast Pump For You | Find Your Perfect Flow | Whisper-Quiet Under 42dB | Cozy Motherhood With Momcozy® | Momcozy M9 Wearable Pump | -300mmHg Strong Suction | 2M+ Global Mom's Choice | Pump More in Less Time | 5 Sessions Per Charge | Track Milk Output in App | Momcozy CA | Award-Winning M9 Pump | Shop Momcozy M9 Today | Pump Anytime, Anywhere | Powerful -300mmHg suction + app control. Pump up to 5 sessions per charge. Shop the M9 now | Hands-free, ultra-quiet. Customize modes & track milk output via the Momcozy app | Save more with Klarna 4-pay. Free shipping, 30-day returns & 1-year warranty across Canada | Milk Boost™, Milk Relief™ & MyFlow™ modes designed for working & busy moms. Order today",
   "anchor": "#广告文案明细/recvuJYdObeVsZ/Primary Text"
  },
  {
   "kind": "field_value",
   "field_name": "修改建议",
   "text": "静音表述改客观参数（as low as 48 dB），避免 whisper/silent/ultra-quiet 绝对化 ▸ 吸力表述改客观参数（up to -300 mmHg、15 adjustable levels），删除 maximum/strongest",
   "anchor": "#广告文案明细/recvuJYdObeVsZ/修改建议"
  },
  {
